From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:33:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd: Check access to profiles and volumes attached through
 an update
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Instance and profile updates only authorized the object being edited,
so a client with edit access to one instance could attach any custom
volume or profile of the project.

This addresses GHSA-8553-6xmq-7g3g (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit e55203328a89b2de00142f39af2886351126787f)
